<section class="footer-info" id="about">
  <div class="info-panel"><span class="micro">ABOUT</span><h2>END CULTURE</h2><p>END CULTURE is an independent menswear label established in 2026. The first release focuses on graphic T-shirts and headwear with a clean, understated identity.</p><a href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=t-shirts">VIEW THE FIRST COLLECTION →</a></div>
  <div class="info-grid">
    <article id="shipping"><h3>SHIPPING</h3><p>We aim to prepare and dispatch orders as quickly as possible. Available delivery services, charges and estimated delivery times will be shown at checkout before you place your order.</p><p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive confirmation using the contact details provided at checkout. Delivery estimates are not guaranteed and may be affected by carrier delays or other circumstances outside our control.</p></article>
    <article id="returns"><h3>RETURNS</h3><p>If you change your mind, you can request a return within 14 days of receiving your order. Once a return has been requested, you then have 14 days to send the item back.</p><p>Items should be unworn, unused and returned in their original condition with any tags attached. This does not affect your rights if an item is faulty, damaged or not as described.</p><p>To start a return, contact us with your order number before sending anything back. Unless the item is faulty or we have made an error, return postage is the customer's responsibility.</p></article>
    <article id="privacy"><h3>PRIVACY</h3><p>Customer information is used to operate the store, fulfil orders and provide requested updates. Checkout and customer data are handled through Shopify.</p></article>
    <article id="terms"><h3>TERMS</h3><p>Products shown before launch are marked Coming Soon and are not yet available to purchase. Final product specifications, prices and availability will be confirmed at launch.</p></article>
    <article id="faq"><h3>FAQ</h3><p><strong>When does END CULTURE launch?</strong><br>The first drop is coming soon. Join the mailing list for release updates.</p><p><strong>What will Drop 001 include?</strong><br>Men's T-shirts and hats.</p></article>
    <article id="contact"><h3>CONTACT</h3><p>Send END CULTURE a message using the form below.</p>{% form 'contact' %}<input type="text" name="contact[name]" placeholder="NAME" required><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="EMAIL" required><textarea name="contact[body]" placeholder="MESSAGE" rows="4" required></textarea><button type="submit">SEND MESSAGE →</button>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p>MESSAGE SENT. THANK YOU.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}{% endform %}</article>
  </div>
</section>
<footer class="footer">
  <div><a class="footer-logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">END CULTURE®</a><p>END THE ORDINARY.</p><p>EST. 2026</p></div>
  <div><h3>SHOP</h3><a href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=t-shirts">T-Shirts</a><a href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=hats">Hats</a></div>
  <div><h3>HELP</h3><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#shipping">Shipping</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#returns">Returns</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#contact">Contact</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#faq">FAQ</a></div>
  <div><h3>ABOUT</h3><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#about">Our Story</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#privacy">Privacy</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#terms">Terms</a></div>
  <div id="newsletter"><h3>JOIN THE CULTURE</h3><p>Be the first to know when we drop.</p>{% form 'customer' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="EMAIL ADDRESS" required><button type="submit">JOIN →</button>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p>YOU'RE ON THE LIST.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}{% endform %}</div>
</footer>
<div class="copyright">© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} END CULTURE. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#privacy">PRIVACY</a> · <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#terms">TERMS</a></div>
{% schema %}{"name":"Footer","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
